## Key Findings

### Machine Downtime

The factory with the highest potential downtime was:

**Daikibo Factory Seiko – 480 minutes**

The device type responsible for the highest downtime at this factory was:

**LaserWelder – 480 minutes**

Other factory downtime totals included:

| Factory | Downtime |
|---|---:|
| Daikibo Factory Seiko | 480 minutes |
| Daikibo Shenzhen | 420 minutes |
| Daikibo Factory Meiyo | 110 minutes |
| Daikibo Berlin | 20 minutes |

